  {
    "tag": "H2",
    "text": "Question before you decide.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-181bxy",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "64px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "72px",
      "letterSpacing": "-1.92px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Ask a question",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-1u9d1dc",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "20px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.07px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Who is this for?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Founders, SaaS teams, and agency owners who need a site that looks like a $10k build without the $10k timeline. If you need something live in weeks, not months, you're in the right place.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "What do you actually help with?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Four things: Landing Pages that convert, full Marketing Sites, Motion Design that makes a site feel alive instead of static, and Framer Implementation if you already have a design and just need it built right. Pick one, or all four.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Are you a designer, or do you also build the site?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Both. I design and build in Framer myself — no handoff, no waiting on a separate developer to \"translate\" the Figma file. What you approve is what ships.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Can you build my site from scratch?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Yes. Bring an idea, a rough deck, or nothing but a product — I'll shape it into a site that's ready to launch, not just \"pretty.\"",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "How much does it cost?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Landing pages start at $4k, full marketing sites at $6k. Motion design and Framer implementation are quoted based on scope. No hourly billing surprises — you get a fixed price before we start.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "How fast can you start?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Usually right away. I keep my schedule open for quick turnarounds — if you need something live this month, tell me and I'll confirm what's realistic.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "How do we work together day to day?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Simple: a kickoff call to lock scope, async updates as I build (no need for daily calls), and a review round before launch. You always know what's done and what's next — no chasing.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "What happens after the site launches?",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-vq8ve3",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.18px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "No. Every project includes 2 weeks of support after launch for any fixes. Need anything beyond that? We'll just scope and price it separately.",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-9nbv7p",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 300\", \"TWK Lausanne 300 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "-0.08px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "H2",
    "text": "Let’s get started!",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-zros4u",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "72px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96)",
      "fontFamily": "\"TWK Lausanne 400\", \"TWK Lausanne 400 Placeholder\", sans-serif",
      "lineHeight": "80px",
      "letterSpacing": "-2.16px"
    }
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Start a project",
    "className": "framer-text framer-styles-preset-1u9d1dc",
    "style": {
      "fontSize": "14px",
